<title>USA: Wayne Savings sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Wayne Savings sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WOOSTER, Ohio 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wayne Savings and Loan Co said Wednesday its board of directors declared a three-for-two split of its common stock which will be distributed as a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The split will be distributed June 12, record May 23.</p>
</text>
